latforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/graphqlapi/directives-reference"}],"title":"API (GraphQL)","description":"Amplify CLI を使用して、Amplify アプリに GraphQL API とデータベースを追加します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/graphqlapi","lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/hosting/index.mdx","title":"ホスティング","description":"Amplify Console または Amazon CloudFront/S3 を使用してアプリをデプロイおよびホストします。Amplify Console は、インスタント キャッシュ無効化とアトミック デプロイなどの機能を備えた完全マネージド ホスティングを提供します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/hosting"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/custom/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/custom/cdk/index.mdx","title":"CDKを使用してカスタムAWSリソースを追加する","description":"Amplify CLIは、AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)を使用してカスタムAWSリソースを追加する機能を提供します。Amplifyプロジェクトで「amplify add custom」コマンドを実行すると、CDKスタータースタックと他のAmplifyで生成されたリソースを参照するメカニズムが提供されます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/custom/cdk"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/custom/cloudformation/index.mdx","title":"CloudFormationを使用してカスタムAWSリソースを追加する","description":"Amplify CLIは、AWS CloudFormationを使用してカスタムAWSリソースを追加する機能を提供します。Amplifyプロジェクトで'amplify add custom'コマンドを実行すると、CloudFormationスターターテンプレートと他のAmplify生成リソースを参照するメカニズムが提供されます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/custom/cloudformation"}],"title":"カスタム AWS リソース","description":"AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) または AWS CloudFormation を使用してカスタム AWS リソースを追加する","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/custom","lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/tags/index.mdx","title":"生成されたリソースにタグを適用する","description":"CLI を通じてタグを付けることで、Amplify が生成した AWS リソースを整理された状態に保つ方法について学びます","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/tags"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/permissions-boundary/index.mdx","title":"Amplify生成ロールのIAMアクセス権限の境界","description":"Amplify CLIで作成されたすべてのIAMロールにアクセス権限の境界を適用します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/permissions-boundary"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/command-hooks/index.mdx","title":"コマンドフック","description":"Amplify CLIコマンド実行の前、最中、後にカスタムスクリプトを実行します(\"amplify push\"、\"amplify api gql-compile\"など)。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/command-hooks"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/monorepo/index.mdx","title":"モノレポプロジェクト構造","description":"Amplify CLIでモノレポワークフローをセットアップする方法を学ぶ","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/monorepo"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/override-iam/index.mdx","title":"Amplifyが生成したプロジェクトレベルのIAMリソースをオーバーライドする","description":"'amplify override project'コマンドは、開発者が構成可能な'overrides'TypeScriptファイルを生成します。このファイルは、認証済みユーザーと未認証ユーザーのためにAmplifyが生成したIAMロールをCDK構成として提供します。例えば、開発者は'amplify override project'を実行して、認証済みおよび未認証のIAMロール名を組織固有の命名規則に準拠するように変更できます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/override-iam"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/troubleshooting/index.mdx","title":"トラブルシューティング","description":"Amplify CLI プロジェクトの一般的なエラーをトラブルシューティングするための情報。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-07-09T18:50:57.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project/troubleshooting"}],"title":"プロジェクトレベルの設定","description":"プロジェクトレベルの設定","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/project","lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/shared/index.mdx","title":"単一環境の共有","description":"複数のチームメンバーが単一のAmplify環境を共有するための推奨ワークフローを学びます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/shared"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/sandbox/index.mdx","title":"サンドボックス環境","description":"Amplifyプロジェクトのサンドボックス環境を有効にする方法を学びます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/sandbox"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/multi-frontend/index.mdx","title":"複数のフロントエンド","description":"同じ Amplify バックエンドを複数のフロントエンド(例: React アプリと Android アプリ)で共有する方法を学びます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/multi-frontend"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/cicd/index.mdx","title":"継続的デプロイメント","description":"Amplify Consoleのマルチ環境機能を使用して、完全にマネージドされたWebアプリケーションホスティングと継続的デプロイメントソリューションを実現します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/cicd"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/commands/index.mdx","title":"コマンド","description":"これらの Amplify CLI コマンドを使用して、複数の環境でチームワークフローを管理します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams/commands"}],"title":"チームの環境","description":"すべてのAmplifyバックエンド環境は、プロジェクトに追加されたカテゴリーのコンテナです。複数の環境では、Amplifyは標準的なGitワークフローに合わせて、よく知られたコマンドを使用して異なるブランチを切り替えられます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-10-25T16:39:44.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/teams"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/lambda-triggers/index.mdx","title":"Lambdaトリガー","description":"Lambdaトリガーは、ユーザーのジャーニーの特定のライフサイクル中に機能を追加する場合に便利です。Lambdaトリガーを認証シナリオ、S3バケット、DynamoDBテーブル、またはAmplify CLIで管理されるKinesis Streamに関連付けます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-06-07T18:09:26.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/lambda-triggers"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/mock/index.mdx","title":"モッキングとテスト","description":"すべての変更をクラウドにプッシュすることなく、Amplifyプロジェクトを迅速にテストおよびデバッグする方法を学びます。API（AWS AppSync）、Storage（Amazon DynamoDBおよびAmazon S3）、Functions（AWS Lambda）を含む特定のカテゴリのローカルモッキングおよびテストを使用します。","platforms":["angular","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/mock"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/containers/index.mdx","title":"サーバーレスコンテナ","description":"AWSにコンテナをデプロイします。サーバーレスコンテナは、アカウント内でREST APIまたはGraphQL APIを構築する際にAWS Fargateを活用します。コンテナは単一のDockerfile定義を使用するか、Docker Composeファイルを使用してデプロイでき、ビルドおよびデプロイメントパイプラインはAWSアカウント内に作成されます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/containers"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/export-to-cdk/index.mdx","title":"Amplify プロジェクトを CDK にエクスポートする","description":"Amplify CLI で生成されたバックエンドを Cloud Development Kit (CDK) スタックとしてエクスポートし、既存の CDK デプロイメント パイプラインに組み込みます。この機能により、フロントエンド開発者はアプリバックエンドを迅速に構築し、シップ準備ができるたびに DevOps チームに本番環境へのデプロイを引き継ぐことができます。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/export-to-cdk"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/headless/index.mdx","title":"CI/CDのヘッドレスモード","description":"Amplify CLIの複数のコマンドは、CI/CDフローで使用できる引数をサポートしています。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage/headless"}],"title":"高度なワークフロー","description":"高度なワークフロー","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/usage","lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/plugins/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/plugins/architecture/index.mdx","title":"アーキテクチャ","description":"Amplify CLIはプラグイン可能なアーキテクチャを持っています。CLIコアはプラグイン可能なプラットフォームを提供し、ほとんどのCLIカテゴリ機能はプラグインとして実装されています。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/plugins/architecture"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/plugins/authoring/index.mdx","title":"新しいプラグインの作成","description":"プラグインを使用すると、既存の Amplify CLI に追加のコマンドと機能を追加できます。プラグインパッケージを作成、公開、使用する方法について説明します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-10-25T16:39:44.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/plugins/authoring"}],"title":"プラグイン","description":"プラグインを使用すると、既存の Amplify CLI に追加のコマンドと機能を追加できます。プラグイン パッケージの作成、公開、使用方法について説明します。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/plugins"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/migration/index.mdx","children":[{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/migration/aws-cdk-migration/index.mdx","title":"AWS CDK v1 から v2 への移行","description":"","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-04-29T18:44:24.000Z","route":"/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/migration/aws-cdk-migration"},{"path":"src/pages/gen1/[platform]/tools/cli/migration/lazy-load-custom-selection-set/index.mdx","title":"レイジーローディングとカスタム選択セット","description":"Swift用のAmplifyライブラリはAPI (GraphQL)を通じたカスタム選択セットをサポートするようになりました。モデルは「has one」および「belongs to」関係のレイジーローディングのサポートを拡張しました。Amplify Studioとandroidからのクロスプラットフォームモデル更新をSwiftで構築されたDataStoreアプリでリアルタイムに監視できます。Amplify swiftは双方向の「has one」データモデリングユースケースをサポートします。","platforms":["android","angular","flutter","javascript","nextjs","react","react-native","swift","vue"],"lastUpdated":"2024-06-05T17:38:43.000Z","route":"/gen1/[plat